---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Karan Mittal | Solutions Architect">
  <main class="container">
    
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="label">Co-Founder & CTO @ Dextar &middot; Community Organiser</p>
        <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Building deterministic, high-performance AI systems.
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 540px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">
          I architect enterprise-scale systems where reliability is the foundation. 
          Co-founder of <a href="https://dextar.co">Dextar</a>, organiser of <a href="/about#community">MLIndore</a> and <a href="/about#community">GDG Cloud Indore</a>, 
          and a technical leader who has shipped across life sciences, semiconductor supply chains, and finance.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
        <img 
          src="/profile.jpg" 
          srcset="/profile-400.jpg 400w, /profile.jpg 800w"
          sizes="(max-width: 720px) 200px, 280px"
          alt="Karan Mittal" 
          width="280" 
          height="280" 
          style="border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: var(--shadow); object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(20%); transition: filter 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;" 
          onmouseover="this.style.filter='grayscale(0%)';this.style.transform='scale(1.02)';this.style.boxShadow='var(--shadow-hover)';"
          onmouseout="this.style.filter='grayscale(20%)';this.style.transform='scale(1)';this.style.boxShadow='var(--shadow)';"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr />

    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      
      <section>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Current Focus</h2>
        <ul style="color: var(--muted);">
          <li>Production-grade GraphRAG with deterministic retrieval</li>
          <li>CPU/GPU co-design for edge LLM inference</li>
          <li>Open-source tooling for reproducible RAG evaluation</li>
          <li>Growing technical communities in Central India</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Connect</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Available for enterprise consulting, architecture reviews, and contract CTO engagements.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/karansmittal/" style="font-weight: 500;">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://twitter.com/KaranSMittal" style="font-weight: 500;">X / Twitter</a>
          <a href="mailto:karanshyammittal@gmail.com" style="font-weight: 500;">Email</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Selected Work</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Explore my architectural work on <a href="https://github.com/Karan-S-Mittal">GitHub</a>, read my <a href="/blog">technical writing</a>, or see my <a href="/talks">talks and workshops</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <a href="https://github.com/Karan-S-Mittal" class="card" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
          <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">GitHub Repositories</p>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0;">Pinned architectural projects and open-source work.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog" class="card" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
          <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">Technical Writing</p>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0;">Essays on GraphRAG, CUDA, and MLOps at scale.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/talks" class="card" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
          <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">Talks & Workshops</p>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0;">Agentverse, Cloud Community Days, Build with AI.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
